Average Population of Each Continent
-----------------------------------
Problem1: Calculate average population per continent

Concepts:
- JOIN
- GROUP BY
- AVG
- FLOOR

Solution:
SELECT COUNTRY.CONTINENT, FLOOR(AVG(CITY.POPULATION))
FROM CITY
JOIN COUNTRY
ON CITY.COUNTRYCODE = COUNTRY.CODE
GROUP BY COUNTRY.CONTINENT;
Learned:
- How GROUP BY works with JOIN
- Why FLOOR is needed

